 -4.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low) (investor cycle week 22 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle broke its start low 15d ago).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): unconfirmed turn. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "\u26a0 Failed cycle \u2014 price broke below the low that began this cycle (15d ago)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average, and it's turning up"], "entry": {"tag": "UNCONFIRMED \u2014 HIGH RISK", "tag_zh": "\u672a\u786e\u8ba4 \u2014 \u9ad8\u98ce\u9669", "urgency": "caution", "text": "An unconfirmed turn: a daily low is forming while the bigger picture is still bearish. Nimble traders only \u2014 small size, defined stop below 23.96. Not an investment buy until the weekly confirms; most of these fail, a minority start a new cycle.", "text_zh": "\u672a\u786e\u8ba4\u8f6c\u5411\uff1a\u65e5\u7ebf\u4f4e\u70b9\u6b63\u5728\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u4f46\u5927\u5c40\u4ecd\u504f\u7a7a\u3002\u4ec5\u9650\u7075\u6d3b\u4ea4\u6613\u8005\u2014\u2014\u5c0f\u4ed3\u4f4d\u3001\u6b62\u635f\u8bbe\u4e8e 23.96 \u4e0b\u65b9\u3002\u5728\u5468\u7ebf\u786e\u8ba4\u524d\u5e76\u975e\u6295\u8d44\u6027\u4e70\u5165\uff1b\u591a\u6570\u6700\u7ec8\u5931\u8d25\uff0c\u5c11\u6570\u5219\u5f00\u542f\u65b0\u5468\u671f\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 37 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "inside the window where a low is due", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 37 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u5904\u4e8e\u4f4e\u70b9\u5e94\u5f53\u51fa\u73b0\u7684\u65f6\u95f4\u7a97\u53e3\u5185", "weekly_line": "Weekly (investor) cycle: week 22 of a typical 16\u201326 weeks", "weekly_phase": "late \u2014 the bigger c